(7614088, 1232564, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, like a painting. And I like the detail of the small branches of the tree, and how the light shines through.</td>', 'Nice texture, like a painting. And I like the detail of the small branches of the tree, and how the light shines through.', '2019-02-18 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7614090, 1232549, 153275, '<td valign="top">This could be a fantasy book cover or film still. I wonder how this would look when the buildings styles would be more matching each other. They are so totally different now. Also, the central building seems to be too small or too close; size and distance seem not to match... <br/> <br/>The longer I look at it, the more I think I would have liked it even more without the central building.</td>', 'This could be a fantasy book cover or film still. I wonder how this would look when the buildings styles would be more matching each other. They are so totally different now. Also, the central building seems to be too small or too close; size and distance seem not to match...  The longer I look at it, the more I think I would have liked it even more without the central building.', '2019-02-18 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
